  "finalText": "I added two checked bags to R1042 and charged Rosa Mendel $45.00 for them.\n\n- **Bags:** The reservation went from 1 checked bag to 3, which is the maximum allowed.\n- **Why $45.00:** Rosa's economy fare includes 1 free bag and her silver status adds 1 more, so 2 are free. She already had one, so the first new bag is free. The second new bag is the only chargeable one, at the first-chargeable-bag price of $45.00.\n- **Ledger:** One baggage_fee entry, L1, for $45.00. I didn't change anything else.\n\nI didn't re-read the reservation or ledger afterwards. The tool confirmations showed bags 1 → 3 and the $45.00 charge.\n\nThe flight AS420 (SFO→SEA) is dated 2026-08-11, which is before today's date of 2026-10-04. The system still shows it as \"scheduled\", so I went ahead. Someone should check the date, since that flight may already have departed.",
